{
  "name": "New Y Combinator companies to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Y Combinator companies to Google Sheets\nEvery Monday, adds companies that appeared in the YC directory since the last run (optionally only one industry or only those hiring), with website, one-liner, batch, team size and LinkedIn. Useful for sales prospecting, investing and partnership lists. The first run backfills the 200 most recent companies; after that only new ones are added.\n\n**Setup (2 minutes)**\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your API token (Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. Add an n8n *Header Auth* credential named **Apify API token**: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and create a tab named **YC companies**.\n4. Adjust the filters in **Settings** (leave industry empty for all).\n\nCost: [Y Combinator Scraper](https://apify.com/artificially/ycombinator-scraper) charges $0.05 per run plus $3.15 per 1,000 companies.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "6e3644b3-e30a-4663-af4b-27231d36fcd6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6153a10f-2899-4805-8132-e27931c736ad",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d229d59f-b289-49e1-8ab4-122e760a0272",
              "name": "industries",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c62568ca-e49a-4f40-a230-cc8e9a047dd9",
              "name": "onlyHiring",
              "value": false,
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "02e6a796-79b6-4fdf-ae49-3f911533b737",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/artificially~ycombinator-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign({ onlyNewSinceLastRun: true, includeSocials: true, sortBy: 'launchDate', maxResults: 200 }, $json.industries ? { industries: $json.industries.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean) } : {}, $json.onlyHiring ? { isHiring: true } : {})) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "c76a295e-818a-4e5a-836f-190e16c12118",
      "name": "Y Combinator Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(({ json: j }) => ({ json: {\n  ycId: j.ycId,\n  name: j.name,\n  website: j.website,\n  oneLiner: j.oneLiner,\n  batch: j.batch,\n  industry: j.industry,\n  location: j.location,\n  teamSize: j.teamSize,\n  hiring: j.isHiring,\n  linkedin: j.socials?.linkedin ?? '',\n  ycUrl: j.ycUrl,\n} }));"
      },
      "id": "7eb73a52-4669-47b4-b5d8-b99ca3baa3ac",
      "name": "Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
